{"title":"One Day, Everyone Will Have Always Been Against This","link":"https://kottke.org/25/03/one-day-everyone-will-have-always-been-against-this","date":1741204679000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/omar-el-akkad-book.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/omar-el-akkad-book.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/omar-el-akkad-book.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2073\" alt=\"a book cover that reads 'One day, when it's safe, when there's no personal downside to calling a thing what it is, when it's too late to hold anyone accountable, everyone will have always been against this'\" /></p>\n\n<p>I love the international cover for Omar El Akkad’s new book, One Day, Everyone Will Have Always Been Against This (<a href=\"https://bookshop.org/a/2966/9780593804148\">Bookshop</a>, <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0593804147/ref=nosim/0sil8\">Amazon</a>). It uses the original text of El Akkad’s tweet about the war in Gaza:</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>One day, when it’s safe, when there’s no personal downside to calling a thing what it is, when it’s too late to hold anyone accountable, everyone will have always been against this.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>The US cover, like many American things, is somewhat less subtle &amp; elegant.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/book%20covers\">book covers</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/books\">books</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Omar%20El%20Akkad\">Omar El Akkad</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/03/one-day-everyone-will-have-always-been-against-this\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"189e01f635b0a34eadb22650edbf8a4c1b3b78355d3efb878c54e4e101415883","category":"Sites"}